WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[Soft piano music plays]
A quiet forest at dawn. Birds chirp in the distance.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Narrator: "In the heart of the wilderness, a story begins..."

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
[Rustling leaves]
A figure emerges from the mist, carrying a lantern.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Stranger: "Is anyone there?"

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
[Silence]
The lantern flickers, casting shadows on the trees.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Narrator: "Every journey starts with a single step..."

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
[Footsteps crunching on leaves]
The stranger walks deeper into the forest.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Stranger: "I know you’re watching."

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
[Distant owl hoot]
The camera pans to reveal an old, abandoned cabin.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Narrator: "But not all who wander are lost."

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
[Door creaks open]
Inside, dust swirls in the sunlight.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Stranger: "Hello?"

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
[Whispering wind]
A shadow moves in the corner of the room.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Narrator: "Some are searching for answers."

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.000
[Thunder rumbles]
The stranger picks up a faded photograph.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Stranger: "Who lived here?"

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
[Clock ticks loudly]
The photograph shows a family, smiling.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Narrator: "And some are searching for the past."

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
[Sudden loud knock on the door]
The stranger freezes.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Stranger: "Who’s there?"

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.000
[Silence]
The door slowly opens...

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Narrator: "But the past isn’t always what it seems."

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.000
[Footsteps approach]
A child’s voice: "Mommy said you’d come back."

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Stranger: "Who are you?"

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
[Laughter echoes]
The child vanishes into the mist.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Narrator: "And sometimes, the past finds you."

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.000
[Lantern flickers out]
Darkness falls.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Stranger: "Wait!"

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.000
[Wind howls]
The cabin door slams shut.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Narrator: "The forest keeps its secrets."

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
[Soft piano music returns]
The stranger sits by the fire, holding the photograph.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Stranger: "I remember now."

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.000
[Fire crackles]
The camera zooms in on the photograph.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Narrator: "And every story has an ending."

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:55.000
[Silence]
The stranger smiles.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Narrator: "But some stories never truly end."

